# "Their controllers sacrifice them": the permanents that were there as the state trigger triggered (CR 603.8; the
# 2014-02-01 ruling: "those permanents will be sacrificed"). City in a Bottle enters with Bot1's Kird Ape on the battlefield
# and triggers; in response Bot2 puts Camel onto the battlefield with Sneak Attack (not cast, so the casting ban is no
# matter). The ability sacrifices Kird Ape alone, and Camel is still there as the ability triggers again once it has left the
# stack - exactly one Arabian Nights permanent - and that second triggering sacrifices it.

